# 统一换行符为 LF，避免跨平台协作产生无意义的 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell 脚本必须是 LF，否则在 macOS / Linux 下无法执行
*.sh text eol=lf

# 锁文件不做 diff 展示
frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated

# 二进制文件
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.bz2 binary
*.dem binary
